      "Section": "LinkedIn Sync Jobs",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-sync-jobs",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "LinkedIn\u0027s Simple Job Posting API enables authorized third parties to post jobs directly to LinkedIn. This is an asynchronous API and you will receive a task id which you can use to see the status of the job, verify whether it successfully posted to LinkedIn, or see if there was an error during creation and view any details about the error.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "LinkedIn Sync Jobs",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-sync-jobs",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Currently only non-premium jobs can be posted via Recruiter System Connect (RSC) offering. Please contact your Business Development point of contact to find out more on Premium Job Postings.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
