      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "LinkedIn Sync Jobs",
      "Anchor": "linkedin-sync-jobs",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Please note that in some cases, we may require certain types of jobs to be promoted on LinkedIn. Jobs that require promotion may include jobs by companies with generic names (such as \u201CConfidential Company\u201D) or jobs from search and staffing companies. These limits are designed to prevent abuse, improve product quality, and increase transparency while ensuring that job seekers have access to the best possible opportunities. Please note that LinkedIn reserves the right to require promotion of jobs.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
